msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:87
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"inputs.nixpkgs = {\n"
"  type = \"github\";\n"
"  owner = \"NixOS\";\n"
"  repo = \"nixpkgs\";\n"
"};\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:95
msgid ""
"Following [RFC 3986](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/"
"rfc3986#section-2.1), characters outside of the allowed range (i.e. neither "
"[reserved characters](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/"
"rfc3986#section-2.2) nor [unreserved characters](https://"
"datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3986#section-2.3)) must be percent-encoded."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:102
msgid ""
"Here are some examples of flake references in their URL-like representation:"
