#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:114
msgid ""
"`github:NixOS/nixpkgs/a3a3dda3bacf61e8a39258a0ed9c924eeca8e293`: A specific "
"revision of the `nixpkgs` repository."
