msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:669
#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:684
#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:692
#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-flake.md:700
