#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-repl.md:37
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix repl --file example.nix\n"
"Loading Installable ''...\n"
"Added 3 variables.\n"
"\n"
"# nix repl --expr '{a={b=3;c=4;};}'\n"
"Loading Installable ''...\n"
"Added 1 variables.\n"
"\n"
"# nix repl --expr '{a={b=3;c=4;};}' a\n"
"Loading Installable ''...\n"
"Added 1 variables.\n"
"\n"
"# nix repl --extra-experimental-features 'flakes' nixpkgs\n"
