"This command deletes the store paths specified by [_installables_](./"
"nix.md#installables), but only if it is safe to do so; that is, when the "
"path is not reachable from a root of the garbage collector. This means that "
"you can only delete paths that would also be deleted by `nix store gc`. "
"Thus, `nix store delete` is a more targeted version of `nix store gc`."
msgstr ""

