"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#OR)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-build.md:557
msgid ""
"If a derivation has multiple outputs, `nix-build` will build the default "
"(first) output. You can also build all outputs:"
