#: source/command-ref/nix-build.md:564
msgid ""
"This will create a symlink for each output named `result-outputname`. The "
"suffix is omitted if the output name is `out`. So if `openssl` has outputs "
"`out`, `bin` and `man`, `nix-build` will create symlinks `result`, `result-"
"bin` and `result-man`. It’s also possible to build a specific output:"
