"The functional tests reside under the `tests/functional` directory and are "
"listed in `tests/functional/meson.build`. Each test is a bash script."
msgstr ""

#: source/development/testing.md:170
msgid ""
"Functional tests are run during `installCheck` in the `nix` package build, "
"as well as separately from the build, in VM tests."
