#: source/development/testing.md:233
msgid ""
"When a functional test fails, it usually does so somewhere in the middle of "
"the script."
msgstr ""

#: source/development/testing.md:235
msgid ""
"To figure out what's wrong, it is convenient to run the test regularly up to "
"the failing `nix` command, and then run that command with a debugger like "
"GDB."
