"Has `O(n)` time complexity, where `n` is the size of the _attrset_. Note "
"that no calls to _f_ are performed by the builtin. The function _f_ is "
"called on demand when a resulting attribute value is evaluated."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2176
msgid ""
"Returns a list if the [extended POSIX regular expression](http://"
"pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/V1_chap09.html#tag_09_04) "
"_regex_ matches _str_ precisely, otherwise returns `null`. Each item in the "
"list is a regex group."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2181
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"builtins.match \"ab\" \"abc\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2185
msgid "Evaluates to `null`."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2187
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"builtins.match \"abc\" \"abc\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2191
msgid "Evaluates to `[ ]`."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2193
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"builtins.match \"a(b)(c)\" \"abc\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2197
msgid "Evaluates to `[ \"b\" \"c\" ]`."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2199
msgid ""
"```nix\n"
"builtins.match \"[[:space:]]+([[:upper:]]+)[[:space:]]+\" \"  FOO   \"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/builtins.md:2203
msgid "Evaluates to `[ \"FOO\" ]`."
